      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i keep expecting to hear him at the door or the sound of his paws on the floor but there's nothing. it feels stupid to be this broken over an animal but the silence is actually deafening. i don't even know why i'm bothering to go through the motions of the day anymore.",
