      "content": "it's just that everything feels so empty. like, the world just keeps spinning and people are all busy and happy and it feels so pointless to be stuck in this quiet house alone. honestly sometimes i feel like there's no point in even trying to heal or move on. it's like the only thing that made sense is gone and now it's just... nothingness.",
